{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37284","headline":"贵公子行 · 秦韬玉","name":"贵公子行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堦前莎球绿不卷，银龟喷香挽不断。\n乱花织锦柳捻线，妆点池台画屏展。\n主人公业传国初，六亲联络驰朝车。\n鬬鸡走狗家世事，抱来皆佩黄金鱼。\n却笑儒生把书卷，学得颜回忍饥面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}